      "number": 49,
      "reviews": [
        {
          "id": "PRR_kwDOT0B_PM8AAAABOYLLdg",
          "author": {
            "login": "Richyboy170"
          },
          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "body": "Approved ✅\n\nThis PR cleanly implements Administrator User Management across the backend and UI:\n\nAdds administrator-only user management routes with proper authorization.\nSupports listing, searching, filtering, creating, editing, and password resets.\nEnforces duplicate-email, password-strength, self-deactivation, and final-administrator safeguards.\nAdds administrator-only UI navigation and responsive management forms.\nIncludes focused frontend and backend tests covering the main workflows and authorization rules.\nThe implementation is well scoped and aligned with the requirements in #48. Nice work!",
